@title Wire numbering: the Numbers tab lists every net, type, fix, unlock
@area Schematic
# Where it is: Ctrl+K "wire numbering" (Edit > Wires). The Numbers tab shows each net with its
# number, potential and page; click a number to type another (fixed), Unlock releases it.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "motor starter dol"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click_text "Motor starter DOL" Label
wait 10
click_text Place Button #2
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "wire numbering"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Numbers ("
expect "Click a number to type another"
expect "Page.col"
expect "no number yet"
shot numbers-tab
# The list keeps most of the height; the scheme block is collapsed.
expect_not "Prefix"
click_text Problems Button
wait 5
shot problems-filter
click_text All Button
wait 3
click_text Preview Button
wait 5
expect "would be numbered"
shot preview-tab
click_text Conflicts Button
wait 5
expect "would be numbered"
shot conflicts-tab
# Number the wires, then type one number by hand: it is fixed and offers Unlock.
click_text Numbers Button
wait 5
click_text "Scheme and mode: sequential, number new wires"
wait 3
shot settings-open
click_text Project Button
wait 3
click_text Number Button #2
wait 15
shot numbered
click_text 2 Button
wait 5
text 105
key Enter
wait 8
expect "Unlock"
shot typed-fixed
click_text Fixed Button
wait 5
shot fixed-filter
click_text Unlock Button
wait 8
expect "Wire number unlocked"
shot unlocked
